<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '44px 56px 24px 56px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#061F32', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>人形机器人收入占比两年从1.88%升至51.07%，完成第一引擎切换</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#061F32', marginTop: 12 }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flex: 1, gap: 32, alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: '58%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Chart
                style={{ height: 460 }}
                chartType='barChart'
                title='人形机器人收入占主营收入比重（%）'
                titleColor='#061F32'
                showLegend={false}
                showDataLabels={true}
                dataLabelColor='#061F32'
                axisColor='#808080'
                colors={['#08A6F6']}
                background='#FFFFFF'
                data={[
                    ['年份', '收入占比'],
                    ['2023', 1.88],
                    ['2024', 27.6],
                    ['2025', 51.07],
                ]}
            />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#808080', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>注：2023年为H1上市当年；2025年前三季度占比51.53%，全年51.07%。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, borderLeft: '3px solid #061F32', paddingLeft: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#061F32', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>反超四足</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#44546A', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>2025年人形收入8.68亿元 vs 四足6.98亿元；增长逻辑已从"四足龙头"切换为"人形第一股"。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, borderLeft: '3px solid #061F32', paddingLeft: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#061F32', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>出货全球第一</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#44546A', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>2025年人形出货超5,500台（纯人形、不含轮式）；四足累计销量超3万台（2022–2025.9）。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, borderLeft: '3px solid #08A6F6', paddingLeft: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#061F32', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>以价换量是主动策略</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#44546A', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>G1等中低价位产品放量 + 主动下调价格，均价连降是为做大规模、摊薄成本，而非被动降价。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#808080', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>来源：招股说明书、2025年年度报告</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#808080', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>07</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
